  "notes": "{気|き}になる is an idiomatic expression meaning to be on one's mind or to bother someone.\n\nMEANINGS:\n1. To worry about: ⟦{結果|けっか}→結果：02486_kekka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{気|き}になる (worried about results)\n2. To be interested in: ⟦あの→あの：00915_ano⟧⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{気|き}になる (interested in that person)\n3. To be bothered by: ⟦{音|おと}→音：00743_oto⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{気|き}になる (bothered by a sound)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{気|き}にする→気にする：03026_kinisuru⟧:\n- {気|き}になる: something weighs on your mind (unintentional)\n- {気|き}にする: to actively worry about or care about (intentional)\n\nNote: The subject is the thing that concerns you, marked with ⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧.",
